# The orientation of unhinted outlines (FT_Outline_Get_Orientation) and of
# their emboldened, slanted and both variants, for contours a font engine
# may meet: clockwise (TrueType's direction) and reversed squares, an outer
# contour with a hole, a pair whose areas cancel, a single point, a zero-area
# contour, figure eights with equal and unequal lobes, off-curve points that
# turn the curve against its control polygon, a glyph without points and one
# with zero advance. The face draws underlines and strike-outs (post and OS/2
# bands present), and its glyphs are mapped to A..O for render fixtures.
family Triergon Orientation
units-per-em 1000
metrics 800 -200
underline -120 60
strikeout 280 60
heights 16384 853
modes outlines
glyph advance 500
end
# A: clockwise square
glyph advance 600 char 0x41
  contour 100 0, 100 700, 500 700, 500 0
end
# B: the square reversed
glyph advance 600 char 0x42
  contour 100 0, 500 0, 500 700, 100 700
end
# C: a clockwise outer contour with a counter-clockwise hole
glyph advance 600 char 0x43
  contour 100 0, 100 700, 500 700, 500 0
  contour 200 100, 400 100, 400 600, 200 600
end
# D: the same with both contours reversed
glyph advance 600 char 0x44
  contour 100 0, 500 0, 500 700, 100 700
  contour 200 100, 200 600, 400 600, 400 100
end
# E: two equal squares, one each way: the areas cancel
glyph advance 900 char 0x45
  contour 100 0, 100 400, 400 400, 400 0
  contour 500 0, 800 0, 800 400, 500 400
end
# F: a single point
glyph advance 600 char 0x46
  contour 300 300
end
# G: a zero-area contour, out along a line and back
glyph advance 600 char 0x47
  contour 100 0, 500 700, 300 350
end
# H: a figure eight with equal lobes
glyph advance 600 char 0x48
  contour 100 0, 500 700, 500 0, 100 700
end
# I: a figure eight with a larger clockwise lobe
glyph advance 600 char 0x49
  contour 100 0, 100 700, 500 0, 500 200
end
# J: a figure eight with a larger counter-clockwise lobe
glyph advance 600 char 0x4A
  contour 100 0, 500 200, 500 0, 100 700
end
# K: a clockwise control polygon whose off-curve points fold the curve back
glyph advance 600 char 0x4B
  contour 100 0, 100 700 off, 500 700, 500 0 off, 300 -400 off
end
# L: counter-clockwise, all off-curve points
glyph advance 600 char 0x4C
  contour 100 300 off, 300 0 off, 500 300 off, 300 700 off
end
# M: a large counter-clockwise contour around a small clockwise one
glyph advance 600 char 0x4D
  contour 0 -100, 600 -100, 600 800, 0 800
  contour 250 300, 250 400, 350 400, 350 300
end
# N: no points, with an advance
glyph advance 400 char 0x4E
end
# O: a clockwise square with zero advance
glyph advance 0 char 0x4F
  contour 100 0, 100 700, 500 700, 500 0
end
